ell, I should probably get back to my own schedule now, but it was really nice chatting with you, Isabella. I hope Valentine's Day goes wonderfully for you and Hobbs Cafe!\n", 'Isabella Rodriguez', 'Isabella Rodriguez', 'Isabella Rodriguez'] 

